$ nexoctl admin replicate info mem
"mem" is in no site replication group.

$ nexoctl admin replicate add mem site-b site-c
Sites mem, site-b, site-c grouped: they synchronize now (follow it with "nexoctl admin replicate info mem").

$ nexoctl admin replicate info mem
Site mem (deployment dep-mem), 0 replicated entries.
